															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606553029" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;" >MrWrong</a></span> <span class="odate time_1463017311 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">12 May 2016 01:41</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2507342">
									

<p>This article is a rewrite of a previous version of SCP-2214 which was originally written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timmytim" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2617518); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2617518&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1463020415" alt="TimmyTim" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2617518)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/timmytim" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2617518); return false;">TimmyTim</a></span>. I would like to thank the Rewrite team and TimmyTim for letting me go through with this rewrite.</p>
<p>I would also like to thank various reviewers: sirpudding (for an earlier version of it that is utterly different from this), Quin/Qlass, GallantBlade, DrRocks and TL333s.</p>
<p>As to what is going on here&#8230;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>SCP-2247 is essentially a vial of &quot;truth serum&quot; that got his wish to be useful come true, in the form of becoming a real human and able to seek the truth from humans.</p>
<p>It spent some time in Argentina and working with the junta, before it was &quot;liberated&quot; by the Serpent's Hand. However, in its time &quot;liberated&quot;, it felt bored over its time in the Library and heard of the Foundation as &quot;Jailors&quot;. Supposing that the Foundation as &quot;jailors&quot; would like its services, it left the Library to seek the Foundation.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

