<blockquote>
<p>it was sighted enquiring civilians for whereabouts to &quot;SCP jails&quot;</p>
</blockquote>
<p>To break down the words, <a href="http://www.dictionary.com/browse/inquire">enquire/inquire</a> is to seek information by questioning. So it is seeking information about &quot;SCP jails&quot;, not necessarily wanting to be in those jails. And there is no evidence suggesting that it wanted to be in containment, only that it asked for Foundation bases and went along with some people claiming to be from that group.</p>
<p>Perhaps it is the word &quot;jail&quot; that stands out, if we consider the connotations behind it. On one hand, that is how SH calls the Foundation. On the other, &quot;jail&quot; brings about the idea of imprisonment and one would usually look for a jail for a few reasons &#8212; break-in, visits, or turn oneself in.</p>

